{"canonicalKey":"personality.pattern_not_identity","contentHash":"42dcb2de260234746d5088a9677cab4ced340b47d9c1b12072b5524a9142a0bc","contentType":"original_synthesis","formalTheoryChunk":false,"schemaVersion":"xinzhili.chunk-preview.v1","sourceKind":"card","status":"draft","text":"九型是观察地图，不是身份标签。九型只适合帮助提出观察问题，不能替代个人经历，也不能被用来诊断、贴标签或限制成长可能。"}
